<title>SINGAPORE: DBS Land buys 38 pct stake in China firm.</title>
<headline>DBS Land buys 38 pct stake in China firm.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>DBS Land said on Thursday its 51 percent owned unit, ESMACO, had bought a 38 percent stake in Shenzhen Xingzhou Esmaco property management Co Ltd (SXEPM).</p>
<p>It said in a statement SXEPM is a joint venture between ESMACO and Shenzhen Airtown (Eastern) Industrial Co Ltd, which holds the remaining 62 percent stake.</p>
<p>SXEPM's initial paid-up capital will be US$360,000.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080) at mb</p>
</text>
